{"obsah":"<p>Surprisingly, even during the summer holidays we sometimes don't know which way to jump. This time we were called to a festival in Hlásná Třebaň for the fire brigade, where there were some really incredibly interesting things to see from the people who protect us. There was even a motorbike riding over a car wreck, which was then cut up and set on fire as part of further rescue demonstrations. Before Třebaň we rode an event at Friendfest with Martin Šimůnek, who couldn't come with us to the next event because of a scheduling conflict and had to ride two shorter shows on his own. Friendfest also offered lots of interesting attractions, and we got to meet the guys from freestyle motocross (Podmol brothers), who were kind enough to lend us their sound system. Both shows were also ridden by Dalibor Šulc on a moto-trial bike and Vlasta Kabeláč with his kids' crew.</p>\n\n<p>Meanwhile Marek Tryner and Michal Budský made a trip to Černčice near Louny, where a village festival celebrated 670 years since the first written mention of the village.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>We're collecting photos from all the events and hopefully everything will come together by the end of the summer holidays.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FFriendfest1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FFriendfest1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248461\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FFriendfest2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FFriendfest2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248464\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6094.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6094.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248458\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6095.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6095.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248459\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6096.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6096.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248460\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6097.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6097.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-248457\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F08%2FIMG_6098.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.